    "expectedRule": "False Testimony Court tracks three evidence nodes (voice_evidence, timeline_evidence, residue_evidence), each paired with a counter-item trap (voice_filter_trap/focus_incense, timeline_checksum_trap/dispel_talisman, residue_sterility_trap/armor_patch). Entering the dungeon freezes entry gear {crossExaminerSabre, forensicVisor, custodyShell, appealSeal} from the equipped loadout into law.entryGear; forensic_visor equipped eliminates field_medic from the suspect pool at entry. Handling a trap with 'counter' consumes its counter item and deals no damage; handling with 'risk' deals damage. When a trap damages the player before its paired evidence is revealed, that evidence becomes contaminated (contaminatedEvidenceIds) unless custody_shell is equipped and unspent, in which case custodyProtectionUsed flips true and the first contamination is prevented. Collecting an evidence node reveals it: a clean revealed evidence is trusted (trusted count +1) and eliminates its paired suspect (voice→field_medic, timeline→security_chief, residue→records_keeper); a contaminated revealed evidence is not trusted and does not eliminate its suspect. Collecting verdict_chamber sets pendingVerdictNodeId='verdict_chamber'; law/resolve-verdict {suspect} at the pending node freezes the original verdict (accusedSuspect, accusationCorrect = suspect === 'route_surveyor', accusationTrustedCount = trusted count at freeze). A correct verdict pays 480 reward points plus a 120 cross_examiner_sabre bonus when the sabre is equipped (trusted count 1 → +600 on both state.rewardPoints and run loot; trusted count 0 → 0); a wrong verdict pays 0. A wrong verdict with appeal_seal equipped and appealUsed false is appeal-eligible (display 翻案：可); collecting appeal_desk sets pendingVerdictNodeId='appeal_desk' and a second resolve-verdict there performs the appeal: the accused suspect and correctness are replaced, the trusted count is inherited from the original verdict, appealUsed flips true, and no reward is paid. After a successful appeal the appeal-entry gates close (错判、携带翻案印玺且未取伪判封存后开放。) and the false_verdict_vault gate closes (当前裁决错误时开放。). The false_verdict_vault gate opens only while the current verdict is wrong; collecting the vault pays its wrong-verdict reward and permanently seals the verdict so appeal is no longer possible (display 翻案：不可， appeal-entry gates closed). The boss gate false_testimony_verdict_chamber_to_false_testimony_judge opens only after the verdict is resolved with no pending verdict (完成裁决且无待处理裁定后开放。); before the verdict, moving onto false_testimony_judge is departure-blocked (原始裁决尚未完成，请先选择指控对象。). Starting the false_testimony_judge boss combat freezes bossVerdictSnapshot {suspect, correct, trustedCount, appealed, eliminatedSuspects} and makes the law immutable: further resolve-verdict commands produce no domain transition, trap damage no longer contaminates evidence, and evidence collects no longer reveal (verified post-boss: a risked voice_filter_trap and a voice_evidence collect leave contaminatedEvidenceIds empty and revealedEvidenceIds unchanged). Boss modifiers during the encounter derive from the frozen verdict; the verified band is a correct verdict with trusted count 1 → encounter.allStatsPercent -4 and outgoingDamage force/art +8. The boss is a real multi-round combat (monsterHp 1479, bossPhase sealed, 7 rounds). The law display status is 声纹：X，时序：X，残留：X（未揭示|净|污染），排除：X，裁刃：有/无，目镜：有/无，护甲：有/无/已用，印玺：有/无，裁决：X，待处理：X，预计奖励：N，翻案：可/不可，Boss快照：X with severity stable/warning/resolved and meter {value: revealed evidence count, max: 3}; the verdict-correct API is core.getCurrentVerdictStatus and the law API is core.getCurrentDungeonLaw. Route gates remove edges from legal adjacent targets when closed, so run/move through them is rejected illegal-move. The truth_archive gate (records_stacks → truth_archive, 原始裁决正确且冻结三份净证后开放。) is unreachable in a normal run because only residue_evidence is reachable before the first verdict while voice_evidence and timeline_evidence sit in the post-boss sealed pocket, so the original verdict can never freeze three trusted evidence; the closed gate plus its illegal-move rejection are the dynamic equivalent evidence. Likewise voice/timeline contamination before the freeze is unreachable; the post-boss risked trap dynamically proves the frozen law can no longer be contaminated. Law state, entry gear, verdict, boss snapshot, and reward points persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
